Z||000000||Monkeyman||02-20-2000||05:28 AM||||Cliff's been hard at work again!  16 hr day on Friday, had to mess with the forum to get rid of that punk Friday pm, worked yesterday, and now he's obviously put more time into the forum last night.  Way to go, Cliff!  YOU da man!  I like the flaming folder thing.  I have a little question, though.  What does the "Disable Smilies in This Post." option do?  Sounds self explanatory, but if you don't want smilies in your post, just don't put them in there?  Must be more to this.||||reg||1
