Z||000006||Cliff Pennock||02-20-2000||10:20 AM||||If you want to reply to a certain message, just click on the "Reply w/Quote" icon. It'll take you to the ordinary reply page, but it will automatically insert the message you're replying to as a quote.<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Monkeyman:<BR><B>Cliff--Sorry, but I have to ask another question.  Will you be explaining how to use some of these new features once you get done supercharging the forum?  I just noticed that now we can reply with a quote (who knows what else you have up your sleeve?!).  I don't have any idea how to use that and I don't want to keep asking every time you add something.  What can be next?  Automatic coffee pot??</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>||||reg||1
