Z||000011||Monkeyman||02-20-2000||01:18 PM||||The explanation is in the "FAQ"s but a little hard to find, IMHO.  Here's what you do:  Type <B> before the words you want highlighted, then </B> after. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>||||reg||1
